== pgcopydb: e-w1 -> e-w2, PostgreSQL 18 ==

-- latency: 1000 single-row transactions, one session, 50 ms apart
p50 0.6 ms, p95 1.8 ms, p99 4.2 ms, rows 1000

-- throughput: pgbench, 8 clients, 30 s, one insert per transaction
   source: tps = 60045.354872 (without initial connection time)
   source committed 1801326 rows; 231123 were on the target when the load stopped; the rest took 74.2 s more
   target applied 17287 rows/s over the whole run, 7704 rows/s while it was loaded

-- one transaction of 1000000 rows
   committed on the source after 1.0 s, complete on the target 9.1 s after that

-- one UPDATE statement of 1000000 rows: update events set payload = payload (REPLICA IDENTITY FULL)
   committed on the source after 2.1 s, complete on the target 633.6 s after that
